  "description": "OpenID Connect and OAuth 2.0 server for ASP.NET Core, certified by the OpenID Foundation. Add a complete identity provider and authorization server to your own .NET application: every OIDC flow, PKCE, PAR, DPoP, JARM, CIBA, device flow, token exchange and FAPI 2.0.",
